.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","login":"clayjohn","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn"},"body":"I'm not sure what has happened between my last review and this one. But this PR has gotten further from being ready for merging. Spamming random changes throughout the shader is bad practice. \n\nRandomly switching between half and float is terrible for performance and defeats the purpose of using half in the first place. \n\nIn its current state this code is nowhere near mergable. \n\nWhat we need to see to make this PR acceptable is:\n1. The code needs to fix actual bugs\n2. The bugs need to exist and not just be hallucinated\n3. Performance cannot regress significantly\n4. The code needs to logically fix the source of the bug, and not just be a random change that happens to work. ","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120884#pullrequestreview-4775325770","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/120884","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-07-24T17:27:43Z"},{"id":4777802926,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHMd8rg","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"9610ca15d1b4409331d2940ae826f781977b75aa","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/100094557?v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Mingxi-Z","id":100094557,"node_id":"U_kgDOBfdSXQ","login":"Mingxi-Z","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Mingxi-Z"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120884#pullrequestreview-47